<title>FINLAND: FINNISH JULY JOBLESS RATE UP TO 16.8 PCT - MINISTRY.</title>
<headline>FINNISH JULY JOBLESS RATE UP TO 16.8 PCT - MINISTRY.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-08-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Finland's jobless rate rose to 16.8 percent in July from 16.5 percent in June, the Labour Ministry said in its monthly employment survey on Thursday.</p>
<p>			July 1997	June 1997     July 1996</p>
<p> Unemployed	   427,922	  420,536	 468,076</p>
<p> Jobless rate (pct)  16.8	     16.5	    18.4</p>
<p>Six economists' average forecast for the July jobless rate measured by the labour ministry had been 16.8 percent (range 16.7-16.9 pct). The ministry's data are not used in international comparisons.</p>
<p>-- Helsinki newsroom +358-9-680 50 245, news@reuters.fi</p>
